  "ingredients": [
    "3 egg yolks",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 cup heavy cream",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon brown sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Move an oven rack to the lowest position.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4i-qSyT6ERGR9OAAoY3gkt1o0gc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-step-01-4x3-0211-934a1f65767b4c47ac7ae0b2bbd5a114.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg yolks, 1/4 white sugar, and vanilla together in a heatproof bowl until smooth. Bring cream just to a simmer in a saucepan over medium-low heat; gradually whisk hot cream into egg yolk mixture (a little at a time to prevent the mixture from scrambling), whisking continuously until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zzQWgTjcAccjttEjZUAHXNzI_us=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-step-02-4x3-021-f30f92b18b884bb982da895049df4084.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a couple of inches of water to a simmer in a saucepan over medium-low heat; set the bowl with cream mixture over the saucepan to form a double boiler. Cook, gently stirring with a wooden spoon, until cream mixture thickens enough to easily coat the back of the spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6d-6FbwF7ZYEJ23iaKNdPDu9gac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-step-03-4x3-022-c3632bd558cd461ea05d2a6f9427fe8f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour hot cream into a heat-proof baking dish or individual ramekins set on a rimmed baking sheet. Place in the preheated oven; bake until mixture sets but has a slight jiggle, about 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fJVHqLbuMkvKeIbuSorl7lWaMeA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-step-05-4x3-027-5f97d29ff2214450878f48acfc9f6423.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chill in the refrigerator for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GkzbvFczCJe1WmZTE6n6g2PJnMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-DDMFS-step-7-4x3-66ed61731eee429f86fec0a368a6bbfb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the topping: Preheat the oven's broiler and set the oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source. Combine 2 tablespoons white sugar and brown sugar in a small bowl; sprinkle evenly over cold crème brûlée.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mM7PS4bCsQQN7_43S5O6CUW5yT0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-DDMFS-step-08-4x3-4438cfe1b6934055a47226b2e7edaa55.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat under the preheated broiler until sugar melts and browns, 2 to 3 minutes; return immediately to the refrigerator and chill until sugar is set, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GJIErl8Yc7-YPil2boHbUZv1SmE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218988-perfect-creme-brulee-DDMFS-step-09-4x3-794c75f1c0844e5dab9310042afd5e5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218988/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
